        <mxCell id="legend_text" value="• No snapshotting — lookup re-evaluates at evaluation time so buyers can adjust targets. SCD2 gives historical accuracy.&#xa;• Workstream accepted by name or ID on WO create (matches ST pattern); resolved against project registry; unknown name fails.&#xa;• Hard cut from custom-field-driven model. No migration. Old shape goes away." style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=11;fontColor=#162741;" vertex="1" parent="1">
